  <section class="sstw-section" id="real-scenarios">
    <h2>4 Realistic Retirement Tax Withholding Case Scenarios (2026)</h2>
    <p>
      Here is how different retirement income mixes translate into actual federal tax liabilities and suggested Form W-4V withholding choices:
    </p>

    <!-- Scenario 1 -->
    <div class="sstw-scenario-card">
      <div class="sstw-scenario-header">
        <span class="sstw-scen-badge">Scenario 1</span>
