        <li>
          <span class="sstw-check-icon">✓</span>
          <div>
            <strong>Step 2: Choose Your Form W-4V Withholding Rate (7%, 10%, 12%, or 22%)</strong>
            <p>Select the percentage that brings your projected April balance closest to zero without excessively shrinking your monthly budget.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="sstw-check-icon">✓</span>
          <div>
            <strong>Step 3: Download and Complete IRS Form W-4V</strong>
            <p>Download <a href="https://www.irs.gov/pub/irs-pdf/fw4v.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: underline;">IRS Form W-4V (PDF)</a>. Enter your name, Social Security Number, and check the box in Line 6 for your chosen rate.</p>
          </div>
